WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.644 --> 00:00:03.605
Aww. You're cute!

2
00:00:03.665 --> 00:00:04.425
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.485 --> 00:00:06.005
I'm a meerkat.

4
00:00:11.507 --> 00:00:12.667
are mongooses.

5
00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:14.027
Where do you live?

6
00:00:32.428 --> 00:00:33.429
We live in Africa.

7
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.912
We like grasslands and deserts.

8
00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:42.335
Do you dig burrows?

9
00:00:43.336 --> 00:00:46.177
Yes. We stay cool and safe underground.

10
00:00:47.939 --> 00:00:49.720
We live in groups called mobs.

11
00:00:52.742 --> 00:00:54.803
Does your mob work together?

12
00:00:55.944 --> 00:00:57.865
Yes. We take turns with jobs.

13
00:00:59.326 --> 00:01:01.328
Some meerkats protect all the babies.

14
00:01:03.212 --> 00:01:04.473
Others watch for enemies.

15
00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:08.154
Who are your enemies?

16
00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.756
Jackals, birds, and snakes eat us.

17
00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:15.137
But we can hide in our burrows.

18
00:01:17.918 --> 00:01:20.439
Or our mob stands together and scares them!

19
00:01:23.781 --> 00:01:25.461
Do you make any sounds?

20
00:01:26.462 --> 00:01:28.202
Meerkats chatter to one another.

21
00:01:29.583 --> 00:01:31.464
We also hiss loudly at enemies.

22
00:01:33.933 --> 00:01:36.033
And we warn each other with alarm calls.

23
00:01:37.874 --> 00:01:39.394
What do meerkats eat?

24
00:01:40.554 --> 00:01:43.215
We eat things like scorpions, spiders, and bugs.

25
00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:46.336
We have a good sense of smell.

26
00:01:49.277 --> 00:01:50.397
That helps us find food.

27
00:01:55.098 --> 00:01:55.878
Here comes a jackal.

28
00:01:56.979 --> 00:01:58.259
I'm going to warn my mob!

29
00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.240
Bye, Meerkat!
